{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>'Void Diver: Escape from the Abyss' </strong>is a multiplayer action game that combines beautiful 2.5D pixel art with the high-stakes tension of an extraction RPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The city you once knew has transformed into a massive dungeon swirling with otherworldly forces. As the manager, you must command 'Divers' as they plunge into this perilous space to recover lost artifacts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, fight, and escape places teeming with aberrations and madness. All for the sake of completing your requests and returning alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COMBAT: Action that Tests Your Limits</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438920/extras/7ccc5493aa8b612787b747b5c61ca704.poster.avif?t=1773995088\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438920/extras/7ccc5493aa8b612787b747b5c61ca704.webm?t=1773995088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438920/extras/7ccc5493aa8b612787b747b5c61ca704.mp4?t=1773995088\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Together or Alone:</strong> Cooperate with up to 3 players to conquer dungeons, or choose to explore the depths as a lone wolf.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Styles:</strong> Choose from a variety of characters, each with unique skills and narratives, to experience different combat styles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hardboiled Action:</strong> Experience sophisticated, high-impact real-time action set amidst the ruins of the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul